@startuml
title MANTA — Whale Detection and Call Synchronization

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "SimOrchestratorNode" as Orchestrator
participant "WhaleDetectionNode" as Detection
participant "OdysseyNode\n(each configured vehicle)" as Vehicle

note over Detection: Vehicle states and whale call may arrive in either order.
Vehicle ->> Detection : Vehicle state
Detection -> Detection : Store vehicle state
Orchestrator ->> Detection : Whale call
Detection -> Detection : Store whale call
Detection -> Detection : Wait until every vehicle state matches the call cycle

loop Each configured vehicle
    Detection -> Detection : Calculate distance to the whale
    Detection -> Detection : Check if vehicle is outside detection range; skip if so
    Detection -> Detection : Calculate bearing to whale
    Detection -> Detection : Add configured bearing noise and wrap angle
    Detection ->> Vehicle : Bearing observation
    Detection -> Detection : Record detection
end

Detection ->> Orchestrator : Whale call processed
note over Detection: Acknowledge even when no vehicle was in range.

@enduml
